      "skos:prefLabel": "iHRIS 4.3.3 code list: role",
      "skos:definition": "The `role` code list as iHRIS 4.3.3 ships it by default: 18 codes from i2ce/module/pages, ihris-common/module/mHero-base, ihris-manage/module/ManageAccessDepartment, ihris-manage/module/ManageAccessFacility, ihris-manage/module/ManageSelfService, ihris-manage/module/ihris-manage, ihris-qualify/module/QualifySelfService, ihris-qualify/module/ihris-qualify. Each term's notation is the iHRIS record id and its label the record's `name`. The source gives no definitions, so every term is a candidate.",
